  unitName: Justice Blade Razak
  unitId: 40986
  unitNumber: 1701
  description: Razak was a student of the progenitor of La Veda fencing. When Razak's
    master declared his intention to abstain from the sacred tournament held to set
    an official national martial art, the leader of a rival sect berated Razak's
    master, calling him a coward. Unable to endure such insults, Razak challenged
    the rival master out of love for his own, and suffered grievous injuries. His
    master ran to his aid and overwhelmed his foe, but was stabbed in the back in
    a cowardly use of assassination techniques. Having lost his master due to his
    own mistakes, Razak attempted vengeance only to perish in the attempt.
  summonDesc: If this sword exists to protect, then I'll take it up willingly! It's
    to defend my master's honor!
  fusionDesc: I just get stronger, as I gain more strength to protect! Watch, Master!
